# ROOFTOP: the title menu, then rooms 1 to 8 played through to the delivery,
# at the game's starting rate of 60 calls a second (one call a frame).
# Each room's inputs come from the game's own room solutions
# (games/rooftop/tests/data/room1.txt to room8.txt, written as calls at 30
# a second), turned into presses with every frame number doubled.
# Run (from boards/desktop): pocketme-sim --boot off --fps 60 --frames 1740 --script rooftop.script --shot <frames> --out <folder>

